'''Rod Parts''' are a core part of {{Skill|Fishing}}. They can be applied to [[Fishing Rods]] to grant various bonuses.

== Overview ==
[[Fishing Rods]] can have {{Green|3}} '''Rod Parts''' applied at once. They can be applied at {{NPCSprite|Roddy}} in the {{zone|Backwater Bayou}} for various perks. There are {{Green|3}} types of '''Rod Parts''':

* '''Hooks''' increases the chance to catch certain items or [[Sea Creatures]].
* '''Lines''' grant stat bonuses.
* '''Sinkers''' grant [[Fishing Rods]] miscellaneous special abilities.

Only one type of '''Rod Part''' may be applied to a [[Fishing Rod]] at once. If the player wants to apply a different '''Rod Part''', they need to remove the previous one first.

