==Trivia==
* When the {{Item|Phantom Rod}} was being removed in the version 0.22 Alpha, the Hypixel development team stated under the second day's changes that there are plans to add a new '''Sinker''' which applies the Phantom Rod's ability to any fishing rod. The Sinker with Phantom Rod's abilities has not currently released yet, as the team said it might take a while as it might necessitate nerfs  to either the Phantom Impel ability or the {{Item|Shredded Line}} in order to make them both compatible and balanced.<ref>[https://hypixel.net/threads/march-12th-backwater-bayou-alpha-testing.5866830/ (March 12th) Backwater Bayou Alpha Testing]</ref> 

